# FSAE TTC data is licensed to registered teams only - NEVER commit or
# redistribute it. Fresh clones: copy TTC_Data/ from the team drive
# (vd_selftest's staleness gate will fail until you do - by design).
TTC_Data/

# Vendor datasheets & team documents (copyright / size). Keep the docs we
# authored: the physics reference and the pipeline diagram stay tracked.
references/*
!references/code_pipeline.mermaid

# MATLAB litter
*.asv
*.autosave
slprj/

# Office lock files
~$*

# OS litter
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Generated outputs - every file here is reproduced by the run_* scripts
plots/

# Design-decision documents, trackers, releases, reports - live on the team
# drive / locally, not in git. The benchmarks CSV stays: run_aero_targets reads it.
organization/*
!organization/comp_benchmarks_2026.csv
/*.xlsx
/VD_toolchain_roadmap.md

# Track source scans and previews (the digitized CSVs the code reads ARE tracked)
tracks/*.png
tracks/__pycache__/
